From a4f028c41ca50aecff029d0c6a03b3085c951a6a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: James Haggerty <james.haggerty@morsemicro.com>
Date: Wed, 19 Aug 2026 12:05:56 +1000
Subject: [PATCH] Vibe-coded reverse proxy

Useful when serving things like ttyd/mediamtx from LuCI
via https (if nothing else, browsers won't like including
non-https iframes etc.).

See: https://github.com/openwrt/uhttpd/pull/41
---
 CMakeLists.txt |   2 +-
 client.c       |  19 ++
 main.c         |  17 +-
 proxy.c        | 571 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 relay.c        |  48 ++++-
 uhttpd.h       |  44 ++++
 6 files changed, 695 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 proxy.c

